+// Two in-combat behaviours for the Sanctum of the Fallen, gated to the live
+// encounter (see the Hakkar triggers). Inert everywhere else.
+//
+// SUPPRESSOR: the Nightmare Suppressors (8497) channel a counter on the Shade
