+}
+
+// --- Navigation-ignored allowlist -------------------------------------------
+//
+// The Steamvault's Main Chambers Access Panels are wall CONTROLS wearing a
+// GAMEOBJECT_TYPE_DOOR template. They spawn in GO_STATE_READY and never leave
